  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investment in Lombard Asia V, L.P.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lombard Asia V, L.P. (LAV) is expected to make equity and equity-linked investments in midsized companies in Asia, primarily in Thailand and Viet Nam, and selectively in Cambodia, the Lao People&apos;s Democratic Republic (Lao PDR), and Myanmar. LAV is expected to pursue investments in sectors that include (i) agriculture logistics, transport, and retailing; (ii) education; (iii) food products; (iv) financial services; (v) health care; (vi) hospitality and restaurants; (vii) human resources and outsourcing; (viii) light manufacturing and construction materials; and (ix) media and entertainment.</narrative>
  </description>
